cscript-style do-files. One per Mata function, one per ado.

Convention:
  test_<name>.do            - unit test
  master.do                 - runs all tests, exits non-zero on failure

Each test:
  1. Sets a deterministic seed
  2. Generates input via simulate_panel
  3. Calls the routine under test
  4. Asserts results against tolerances declared in PLAN.md "Validation strategy"
